### Product Service — Slip Output Format Slice fixtures
### 본 슬라이스에서 추가된 2 endpoint:
###   1) POST /products/internal/lookup-by-model  (X-Internal-Token, 단건/404)
###   2) GET  /products/by-model/{modelName}      (모든 인증 role 조회, 404 분기)
###
### 사용법:
###   1) docker-compose up (api-gateway / auth-service / user-service / product-service / postgres / eureka)
###   2) 토큰을 @salesToken 등에 채우고 (auth-service /auth/login 응답)
###   3) ### 블록을 위에서 아래로 실행

@host = http://localhost:8080
@productServiceDirect = http://localhost:8084
@internalToken = test-internal-token
@masterToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]
@managerToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]
@salesToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]
@warehouseToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]
@accountantToken = [테스트 환경 시드 후 주입]

### 기존 시드 모델명 (V2 시드 또는 IT setUp 에서 등록).
@existingModel = SHA-W15K
@missingModel = UNKNOWN-MODEL-9999

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 A1: internal lookup-by-model — 정상 (X-Internal-Token, 200)
### 기대: 200 + ApiResponse<ProductSummaryResponse> ($.data.modelName == SHA-W15K)
###############################################################################
POST {{productServiceDirect}}/products/internal/lookup-by-model
X-Internal-Token: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelName": "{{existingModel}}"
}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 A2: internal lookup-by-model — 미존재 모델명 → 404
### 기대: 404 BusinessException(NOT_FOUND) + 한국어 에러 메시지 substring
###############################################################################
POST {{productServiceDirect}}/products/internal/lookup-by-model
X-Internal-Token: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelName": "{{missingModel}}"
}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 A3: internal lookup-by-model — 토큰 누락 → 401
### 기대: 401 (InternalTokenFilter 가 service 진입 차단)
###############################################################################
POST {{productServiceDirect}}/products/internal/lookup-by-model
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelName": "{{existingModel}}"
}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 A4: internal lookup-by-model — 토큰 불일치 → 401
###############################################################################
POST {{productServiceDirect}}/products/internal/lookup-by-model
X-Internal-Token: wrong-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelName": "{{existingModel}}"
}

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 B1: public by-model — SALES 조회 (gateway 경유)
### 기대: 200 + ApiResponse<ProductResponse> ($.data.modelName)
###############################################################################
GET {{host}}/products/by-model/{{existingModel}}
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Accept: application/json

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 B2: public by-model — MANAGER 조회
###############################################################################
GET {{host}}/products/by-model/{{existingModel}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 B3: public by-model — WAREHOUSE 조회 (모든 role 조회 가능 검증)
###############################################################################
GET {{host}}/products/by-model/{{existingModel}}
Authorization: Bearer {{warehouseToken}}
Accept: application/json

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 B4: public by-model — 미인증 → 403
### 기대: 403 (HeaderAuthenticationFilter 가 SecurityContext 미설정)
###############################################################################
GET {{host}}/products/by-model/{{existingModel}}
Accept: application/json

###############################################################################
### 시나리오 B5: public by-model — 미존재 모델명 → 404
### 기대: 404 BusinessException(NOT_FOUND), 메시지 한국어 substring
###############################################################################
GET {{host}}/products/by-model/{{missingModel}}
Authorization: Bearer {{salesToken}}
Accept: application/json
